    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>DITS Dynamic Global Discounts allows you to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Set a global storewide percentage discount</li>\n<li>Apply individual discounts per product</li>\n<li>Schedule discounts with start and end dates</li>\n<li>Keep original prices intact in the database</li>\n</ul>\n<p>All discounts are applied dynamically using WooCommerce filters.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code></li>\n<li>Activate the plugin</li>\n<li>Go to WooCommerce <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Global Sale</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20modify%20product%20prices%20in%20the%20database%3F\">\nDoes it modify product prices in the database?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No. All discounts are applied dynamically via filters.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20support%20variable%20products%3F\">\nDoes it support variable products?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<p>Initial release.</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Apply global and per-product percentage discounts in WooCommerce without modifying database prices.",
    "description": "<p>DITS Dynamic Global Discounts allows you to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Set a global storewide percentage discount</li>\n<li>Apply individual discounts per product</li>\n<li>Schedule discounts with start and end dates</li>\n<li>Keep original prices intact in the database</li>\n</ul>\n<p>All discounts are applied dynamically using WooCommerce filters.</p>\n",
